.build/

# E32: the agent_registry module's capture file. THE MODULE NO LONGER WRITES OR READS IT — the
# registry id is not passed through Terraform at all any more (the backend resolves it from the
# registry NAME, which is what made `terraform apply` single-pass from zero; see
# modules/agent_registry/main.tf). This entry is retained so a working directory left over from
# an earlier apply keeps its stale artifact out of git; it can be deleted, along with any such
# file, once no old working directories remain.
modules/agent_registry/.terraform-registry-*.json
